  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design &amp; build of an aquaculture park in Taragoli, Apac District, Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Aquaculture Park (aquaculture operations facility) is to be designed and built at Taragoli, Apac District on land of approximately 60 acres along the River Nile. The area is currently a virgin site, and the land has been has been procured for the project by the Government of Uganda. It will include house various operational components, including buildings, associated ponds for fish grow-out, a hatchery for hatching and rearing fish fingerlings and associated equipment, ice making and cold storage equipment, maintenance and storage facilities and areas, offices, accommodation block, feed storage and others area. General site access requirements, road, power and drainage, pump houses, fencing and access security aspects will also be included.</narrative>
  </description>
